  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| autodll-webpack-plugin | devDependencies | minor | `0.3.9` -> `0.4.2` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin</summary>\n\n### [`v0.4.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/compare/0.4.0...7125ff2fb0e38c6a70d7a9a0836d32f46d237911)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/compare/0.4.0...7125ff2fb0e38c6a70d7a9a0836d32f46d237911)\n\n### [`v0.4.0`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/releases/0.4.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/compare/0.3.9...0.4.0)\n\nSpecial thanks to [@&#8203;mhheise](https://renovatebot.com/gh/mhheise) & [@&#8203;faceyspacey](https://renovatebot.com/gh/faceyspacey) for their work on the webpack 4 support ❤️\n\n#### Features\n\n-   webpack 4 support [#&#8203;106](https://renovatebot.com/gh/asfktz/autodll-webpack-plugin/issues/106) \n\n#### Breaking Changes\n\n-   Removed support for webpack 3 and below. if you need it,  use `0.3.8` instead\n\nCommitters:\n\n-   Matt Heise [@&#8203;mhheise](https://renovatebot.com/gh/mhheise)\n-   James Gillmore [@&#8203;faceyspacey](https://renovatebot.com/gh/faceyspacey)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
